  METHOD ipo_zsc_tm_ei_edi_mods_1~get_doc_currency.
*"------------------------------------------------------------------------*
*" Declaration of POST-method, do not insert any comments here please!
*"
*"methods GET_DOC_CURRENCY
*"  importing
*"    !IT_CHARGE_ITEM type /SCMTMS/T_TCC_CHRGITEM_K
*"    !IT_ORG_KEY_LINK type /SCMTMS/IF_TCC_PREPROC=>TT_ORG_KEY_LINK
*"    !IT_BUS_DATA type /SCMTMS/T_TCC_COMM_ROOT
*"    !IT_ROOT_KEY type /BOBF/T_FRW_KEY
*"    !IT_CHARGE_ITEM_DO type /SCMTMS/T_TCC_CHRGITEM_K
*"    !IS_ROOT_KEY type /BOBF/S_FRW_KEY
*"    !IS_CTX type /BOBF/S_FRW_CTX_ACT
*"    !IT_CHARGE_ITEM_REF type /SCMTMS/T_TCC_CHRGITEM_K
*"    !IS_HOST_INFO type ref to /SCMTMS/S_TCC_HOST_CURR optional
*"  changing
*"    !EV_TRIGGER_DET type BOOLE_D
*"    !EV_INVOICE_FIX_CURR type BOOLE_D
*"    !EV_DOC_CURR type WAERS
*"    !EV_LCL_CURR type /SCMTMS/LCL_CURRENCY
*"    !EV_FIX_CURRENCY type BOOLE_D
*"    !CV_TARIFF_DET type /SCMTMS/CALC_LEVEL .
*"------------------------------------------------------------------------*
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& Enhancement Implementation - ZSC_TM_E1_FSD_POST_DIFF_CURR           *
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& Class      : /SCMTMS/CL_TCC_A_CALC_BASE                             *
*& Method     : GET_DOC_CURRENCY                                       *
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& NOTE :                                                              *
*& The beow data's are read from Charge Calculation inbound proxy :    *
*& TransportationOrderChargeElementRequest_In. This data is ensured to *
*& make sure the below logic is restricted only for EDI processings.   *
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& MODIFICATION LOG:                                                   *
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& VERSION |   TR NO.   |DATE(DD.MM.YYYY)|  DEVLOPER   |   RITM/INC    *
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*&  V001   | S4DK983607 |   16.04.2026   |   KROSHAN   | RITM4022621   *
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*

*.... CONSTNAT DECLERATION
    CONSTANTS : lc_stack_data_1 TYPE char100 VALUE '(SAPLZSC_TM_EWM_TOOLS)GV_FSD_POSTING_FLAG',
                lc_stack_data_2 TYPE char100 VALUE '(SAPLZSC_TM_EWM_TOOLS)GV_DIFFERENT_CURRENCY_POSTING',
                lc_stack_data_3 TYPE char100 VALUE '(SAPLZSC_TM_EWM_TOOLS)GT_INVOICE010_COST'.

*.... FIELD SYMBOL DECLERATION
    FIELD-SYMBOLS: <lfs_fsd_posting_flag>       TYPE any,
                   <lfs_different_curr_posting> TYPE any,
                   <lfs_charge_lines>           TYPE any,
                   <lfs_charge_lines_t>         TYPE ytm_t_invoice010_cost.

*.... CHECK FOR FSD POSTING FLAG
    ASSIGN (lc_stack_data_1) TO <lfs_fsd_posting_flag>.
    IF <lfs_fsd_posting_flag> IS ASSIGNED .
      IF <lfs_fsd_posting_flag> = abap_true. "if Yes proceed

*.... CHECK FOR FSD DIFFERENT CURRENCY POSTING FLAG
        ASSIGN (lc_stack_data_2) TO <lfs_different_curr_posting>.
        IF <lfs_different_curr_posting> IS ASSIGNED.
          IF <lfs_different_curr_posting> = abap_true. "if Yes proceed

*.... GET THE DIFFERENT CURRENCY TO BE POSTED
            ASSIGN (lc_stack_data_3) TO <lfs_charge_lines>.
            IF <lfs_charge_lines> IS ASSIGNED.
              ASSIGN <lfs_charge_lines> TO <lfs_charge_lines_t>.
              IF <lfs_charge_lines_t> IS ASSIGNED.
                IF <lfs_charge_lines_t> IS NOT INITIAL. "if Yes proceed
                  READ TABLE <lfs_charge_lines_t> ASSIGNING FIELD-SYMBOL(<lfs_charge_line>) INDEX 1.
                  IF sy-subrc = 0.
                    IF <lfs_charge_line> IS ASSIGNED.
                      ev_trigger_det      = abap_true.
                      ev_invoice_fix_curr = abap_true.
                      ev_fix_currency     = abap_true.
                      IF ev_doc_curr <> <lfs_charge_line>-from_curr .
                        ev_doc_curr = <lfs_charge_line>-from_curr.
                        ev_lcl_curr = <lfs_charge_line>-to_curr.
                      ELSEIF  ev_doc_curr <> <lfs_charge_line>-to_curr .
                        ev_doc_curr = <lfs_charge_line>-to_curr.
                        ev_lcl_curr = <lfs_charge_line>-from_curr.
                      ENDIF.
                    ENDIF.
                  ENDIF.
                ENDIF.
              ENDIF.
            ENDIF.
          ENDIF.
        ENDIF.
      ENDIF.
    ENDIF.
  ENDMETHOD.
